  "details": "It is difficult for me to flick my wrist down in order to click the bottom menu tabs. It would be nice to have an option to display them on the top portion of the UI, as it is easier to move my wrist upwards than downwards to select (considering the buttons are smaller and require you to be more precise to click). This would be especially helpful for users with wrist injuries, as they can more easily navigate the virtual laser by adjusting with their elbow, by bending it so that it is pointing up (pointing down would cause your hand to go through the menu because of the extension of the joint).",
